+      "reading 80. The unexplained 30 SURVIVES into the second window (distance 30) instead of "
+      "being absorbed into a fresh baseline — which is what reconcile() does today and why §4-5b "
+      "and §4-5e both read CLEAN at t+1",
+      _rq["predicted"] == [50.0] and _rq["distance"] == 30.0,
+      {"predicted": _rq["predicted"], "distance": _rq["distance"]})
